  "title": "Cream Cheese Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "The addition of cream cheese in this chocolate chip cookie recipe results in deliciously moist, cake-like cookies. Easy to make and irresistible!",
  "authors": [
    "Melissa Marsh"
  ],
